sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box rgb(20,24,30) User Machine
        participant app as App
        participant browser as Browser<br>(User Agent)
    end
    box rgb(20,24,30) ESS
        participant idp as IdP
        participant backend as SciCat BE
    end

    rect rgb(118,51,51)
    note right of app: OAuth 2.0 Device flow w/ PKCE
    app->>app: PKCE: gen challenge + verifier
    app->>idp:Start device flow w/ PKCE challenge
    idp->>app:Verification URL<br>Device code<br>User code
    app->>browser:Open verification URL w/ user code
    loop Until success or timeout
        app->>idp:Request token w/ device code + PKCE verifier
        idp->>app:Return 400 (pending)
    end
    idp->>app:Return access token
    end

   rect rgb(44,102,118)
   note right of app: Exchange for SciCat token
   app->>backend:Request SciCat JWT w/ IdP access token
   backend->>backend:Verify access token<br>using IdP pub key
   backend->>backend:Create SciCat JWT
   backend->>app:Return SciCat JWT
   end
